### get all

GET  http://localhost:8080/api/students?page=2&size=2

### get by id
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/students/12

### get by name
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/students/search?name=Ana&page=1&size=1

### get courses by student id

GET   http://localhost:8080/api/students/4/courses?page=1&size=2
### create

POST  http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "New Student",
    "email":"newstudent@example.com",
    "active":true
}


###

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/12
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Nuevo estudiante",
    "email":"nuevo@example.com",
    "active":true
}

### 
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/2


